Java Script ->
--------------------------------------------------------------
In SAP CPI, JavaScript can be used as a scripting language within the "Script" palette element
to perform data transformations and custom logic. You can either write JavaScript code directly
in the script editor or upload a script file. This allows for more flexibility in message
processing than standard mapping options.


config :  (General, Processing)

Processing :

Script File (Select) :
-> select the script file

Script Function (ET) :
-> Enter the function name that has to be  initially called for script execution


